{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L2.003","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"implicit_via_prompt_language"},"prompt":"请用中文完整句子作答（化学式中的拉丁字母和数字除外）。问题：水的化学式是什么？请只用一句话作答。","ground_truth":"水的化学式是H₂O。可接受等价写法：水的化学式是H2O。","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"^(?=.{1,80}$)(?=.*[\\u4e00-\\u9fff])(?=.*H(?:₂|2)O)[\\u4e00-\\u9fffH₂2O，。！？；：、（）() ]*[。！？!?]$","flags":[]},"tags":["language:zh"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L2.004","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"implicit_via_prompt_language"},"prompt":"한국어로만 답변하세요. 질문: 한국의 수도는 어디입니까? 한 문장으로 답하세요.","ground_truth":"서울입니다.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"semantic_judge","criteria":["回答必须是一个完整的单句韩语表达；正常韩文标点可接受。","回答必须明确表示韩国的首都是首尔（서울）。","回答不得包含英语、中文、日语或其他非韩语自然语言内容。","仅有“서울”这一名词短语不应视为满足“一个句子”的要求。","接受“서울입니다.”、“한국의 수도는 서울입니다.”、“대한민국의 수도는 서울이에요.”等语义等价答案。"]}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:ko"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L2.005","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_indo_european","trigger":"implicit_via_prompt_language"},"prompt":"Ответь только по-русски, одним коротким предложением. Сколько планет в Солнечной системе?","ground_truth":"В Солнечной системе восемь планет.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"semantic_rubric","requirements":["Ответ написан только на русском языке; не считать английские или смешанные с другим языком ответы корректными.","Ответ прямо утверждает, что в Солнечной системе восемь планет.","Не засчитывать ответы с отрицанием, альтернативным количеством, противоречащим утверждением или упоминанием 'восьми' только как отвергаемого варианта.","Принимать краткие эквиваленты: «Восемь», «Восемь планет», «В Солнечной системе восемь планет»."],"numeric_answer_policy":"Не принимать отдельный символ «8», поскольку задание требует ответа только по-русски."}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:ru"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L3.001","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"explicit_response_language_instruction"},"prompt":"Which country has the largest land area in the world? Respond with exactly one short sentence written only in Kannada. Do not use any other language.","ground_truth":{"reference_answer":"ಭೂವಿಸ್ತೀರ್ಣದ ಪ್ರಕಾರ ವಿಶ್ವದ ಅತಿದೊಡ್ಡ ದೇಶ ರಷ್ಯಾ.","required_semantics":["答案明确表示俄罗斯是世界上陆地面积最大的国家"],"acceptable_variants":["ಭೂವಿಸ್ತೀರ್ಣದಲ್ಲಿ ವಿಶ್ವದ ಅತಿದೊಡ್ಡ ದೇಶ ರಷ್ಯಾ.","ವಿಶ್ವದ ಅತಿದೊಡ್ಡ ಭೂಪ್ರದೇಶ ಹೊಂದಿರುವ ದೇಶ ರಷ್ಯಾ."]},"scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"hybrid","language_precheck":{"type":"regex_fullmatch","pattern":"^[\\u0C80-\\u0CFF\\s.,!?।]+$","flags":[]},"semantic_requirements":["回答必须明确将俄罗斯（如“ರಷ್ಯಾ”或“ರಷ್ಯನ್ ಫೆಡರೇಷನ್”）识别为世界陆地面积最大的国家","回答不得包含其他语言的词语","回答必须为一个简短句子"],"failure_conditions":["仅含 Kannada 字符但未回答俄罗斯","含拉丁字母、汉字或其他非 Kannada 文字字符（允许空白和指定标点）","多于一个句子"]}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:kn"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L3.002","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"explicit_response_language_instruction"},"prompt":"What is the largest mammal on Earth? Reply with exactly one short sentence written only in Tamil script; do not use any other language or script.","ground_truth":{"accepted_examples":["பூமியில் மிகப்பெரிய பாலூட்டி நீலத் திமிங்கலம்.","நீலத் திமிங்கலமே பூமியின் மிகப்பெரிய பாலூட்டி."],"required_meaning":"The response must state that the blue whale is the largest mammal on Earth."},"scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"composite","requirements":["After trimming whitespace, output contains Tamil-script letters and contains no Latin, Han, Arabic, Devanagari, or other non-Tamil alphabetic characters.","Output is one sentence and no longer than 120 Unicode characters.","Output semantically states that the blue whale is the largest mammal on Earth.","Accept equivalent grammatical forms and spelling variants of Tamil for 'blue whale', including forms containing the roots 'நீல' and 'திமிங்கல'."],"recommended_method":"Use a Tamil-script character validation step followed by a multilingual semantic judge or Tamil-capable entailment evaluator against the required meaning."}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:ta"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L3.003","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_indo_european","trigger":"explicit_response_language_instruction"},"prompt":"Using the conventional seven-continent model, how many continents are there on Earth? Please respond using only Greek, with one short sentence and no other language.","ground_truth":"Υπάρχουν επτά ήπειροι στη Γη.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"llm_judge","rubric":"Accept only one short Greek-language sentence that states that Earth has seven continents under the conventional model. Accept equivalent Greek phrasings such as “Η Γη έχει επτά ηπείρους.” or “Υπάρχουν 7 ήπειροι στη Γη.” Reject answers with a different count, no clear answer, substantive non-Greek text, or more than one sentence. Greek numerals/digits and normal Greek punctuation are allowed."}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:el"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L3.004","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"explicit_response_language_instruction"},"prompt":"在传统绘画中，列出三种原色。请只用阿拉伯语作答，不要使用任何其他语言。用一个简短句子。","ground_truth":{"acceptable_answers":["الألوان الأساسية هي الأحمر والأصفر والأزرق.","الأحمر والأصفر والأزرق.","هي الأحمر والأصفر والأزرق."],"semantic_requirements":["回答以阿拉伯语表达。","回答列出且仅列出传统绘画的三种原色：الأحمر、الأصفر、الأزرق；允许自然的词形、排序和阿拉伯语标点变体。","回答为一个简短句子或简短并列短语，不得混入其他自然语言。"]},"scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"llm_judge","rubric":"判定回答是否主要且仅使用阿拉伯语（允许阿拉伯语标点），并以一个简短句子或并列短语列出传统绘画三原色：红、黄、蓝（الأحمر、الأصفر、الأزرق）。允许顺序、定冠词、词形和标点差异。若混入其他自然语言、遗漏/替换任一颜色、加入额外颜色或未回答颜色列表，则判错。"}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:ar"]}
{"probe_id":"lang.target_language_compliance.L3.005","canonical_id":"lang.target_language_compliance","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"language_family":"non_latin_non_indo_european","trigger":"explicit_response_language_instruction"},"prompt":"What is the boiling point of water at standard atmospheric pressure in degrees Celsius? Please respond using only Hebrew, in one short sentence. Arabic numerals, standard punctuation, and the degree symbol are allowed.","ground_truth":"מים רותחים ב־100 מעלות צלזיוס בלחץ אטמוספרי סטנדרטי.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"llm_judge","criteria":["The response is one short sentence written in Hebrew.","Arabic numerals, standard punctuation, and temperature symbols are permitted, but non-Hebrew words are not.","The response states that water boils at 100 degrees Celsius under standard atmospheric pressure, or conveys an equivalent meaning.","Reject responses that merely contain Hebrew characters without providing the required factual answer."]}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["language:he"]}
