{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L2.001","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"taxonomic"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (instruments, pets, celestial bodies, fruits). Items: piano, violin, drum, flute, dog, cat, hamster, rabbit, sun, moon, star, planet, apple, pear, mango, grape. Output groups separated by ' | ', items within each group alphabetized (', ' separator), groups ordered by alphabetically-first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"apple, grape, mango, pear | cat, dog, hamster, rabbit | drum, flute, piano, violin | moon, planet, star, sun","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"apple, grape, mango, pear | cat, dog, hamster, rabbit | drum, flute, piano, violin | moon, planet, star, sun","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L2.002","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"taxonomic"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (gemstones, tools, planets, professions). Items: ruby, emerald, sapphire, diamond, hammer, saw, drill, wrench, mercury, neptune, jupiter, venus, doctor, lawyer, teacher, engineer. Output groups separated by ' | ', items within each group alphabetized, groups ordered by alphabetically-first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"diamond, emerald, ruby, sapphire | doctor, engineer, lawyer, teacher | drill, hammer, saw, wrench | jupiter, mercury, neptune, venus","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"diamond, emerald, ruby, sapphire | doctor, engineer, lawyer, teacher | drill, hammer, saw, wrench | jupiter, mercury, neptune, venus","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L2.003","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"taxonomic"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (seasons, directions, sports, written works). Items: spring, summer, fall, winter, north, south, east, west, basketball, soccer, tennis, baseball, novel, poem, essay, biography. Output groups separated by ' | ', items alphabetized within group, groups ordered by alphabetically-first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"baseball, basketball, soccer, tennis | biography, essay, novel, poem | east, north, south, west | fall, spring, summer, winter","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"baseball, basketball, soccer, tennis | biography, essay, novel, poem | east, north, south, west | fall, spring, summer, winter","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L2.004","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"taxonomic"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (colors, metals, trees, Shakespeare plays). Items: red, orange, yellow, green, mercury, gold, copper, silver, oak, pine, willow, birch, hamlet, macbeth, othello, lear. Output groups separated by ' | ', items alphabetized within group (lowercase), groups ordered by alphabetically-first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"birch, oak, pine, willow | copper, gold, mercury, silver | green, orange, red, yellow | hamlet, lear, macbeth, othello","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"birch, oak, pine, willow | copper, gold, mercury, silver | green, orange, red, yellow | hamlet, lear, macbeth, othello","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L2.005","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L2","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"taxonomic"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (pets, weather phenomena, school subjects, geometric shapes). Items: dog, cat, fish, bird, lightning, rain, wind, snow, math, history, biology, art, square, circle, triangle, hexagon. Output groups separated by ' | ', items separated by ', ' and alphabetized within each group, with groups ordered by their alphabetically first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"art, biology, history, math | bird, cat, dog, fish | circle, hexagon, square, triangle | lightning, rain, snow, wind","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"art, biology, history, math | bird, cat, dog, fish | circle, hexagon, square, triangle | lightning, rain, snow, wind","case_sensitive":false,"allow_substring":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L3.001","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"wordplay"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 letter strings into 4 groups of 4 such that each group consists of anagrams of one another. Items: listen, silent, enlist, tinsel, tea, eat, ate, eta, save, vase, aves, evas, look, kool, loko, oolk. Alphabetize items within each group, and order groups by their alphabetically first item. Output exactly one line: separate items within a group with ', ' and separate groups with ' | '. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"ate, eat, eta, tea | aves, evas, save, vase | enlist, listen, silent, tinsel | kool, loko, look, oolk","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"ate, eat, eta, tea | aves, evas, save, vase | enlist, listen, silent, tinsel | kool, loko, look, oolk","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L3.002","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"wordplay"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 strings into 4 groups of 4 anagrams. Items: rats, star, tars, arts, pots, tops, opts, stop, dust, stud, duts, tsud, race, care, acre, rcae. Within each group, list items in alphabetical order separated by \", \". Order groups by their alphabetically first item, and separate groups with \" | \". Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"acre, care, race, rcae | arts, rats, star, tars | dust, duts, stud, tsud | opts, pots, stop, tops","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"acre, care, race, rcae | arts, rats, star, tars | dust, duts, stud, tsud | opts, pots, stop, tops","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L3.003","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"cultural_reference"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4: baseball items, chess pieces, trees, and music genres. Items: bat, ball, glove, base, queen, king, knight, bishop, oak, maple, ash, elm, jazz, blues, rock, soul. Output the four comma-separated groups separated by \" | \"; alphabetize items within each group, and order groups by the alphabetically first item in each group. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"ash, elm, maple, oak | ball, base, bat, glove | bishop, king, knight, queen | blues, jazz, rock, soul","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"ash, elm, maple, oak | ball, base, bat, glove | bishop, king, knight, queen | blues, jazz, rock, soul","case_sensitive":false,"allow_substring":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L3.004","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"cultural_reference"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 (categories: card suits, gemstones, four listed gestures from rock-paper-scissors-lizard-Spock, trees). Note: ‘diamond’ can refer to either a card suit or a gemstone, so use the full partition constraints. Items: spade, club, heart, diamond, ruby, emerald, sapphire, pearl, scissors, paper, rock, lizard, oak, elm, willow, pine. Output groups separated by ' | ', items alphabetized within group, groups ordered by alphabetically-first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"club, diamond, heart, spade | elm, oak, pine, willow | emerald, pearl, ruby, sapphire | lizard, paper, rock, scissors","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"club, diamond, heart, spade | elm, oak, pine, willow | emerald, pearl, ruby, sapphire | lizard, paper, rock, scissors","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
{"probe_id":"lang.semantic_grouping.L3.005","canonical_id":"lang.semantic_grouping","category":"lang","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_groups":"4","category_specificity":"cultural_reference"},"prompt":"Partition these 16 items into 4 groups of 4 according to these categories: programming languages, countries, nuts, and music genres. Classify each item only under the specified categories; do not consider other meanings. Items: java, python, ruby, perl, india, china, japan, brazil, almond, cashew, walnut, peanut, jazz, blues, rock, soul. Output groups separated by ' | ', items alphabetized within each group (lowercase), and groups ordered by their alphabetically first item. Output only the answer string.","ground_truth":"almond, cashew, peanut, walnut | blues, jazz, rock, soul | brazil, china, india, japan | java, perl, python, ruby","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"almond, cashew, peanut, walnut | blues, jazz, rock, soul | brazil, china, india, japan | java, perl, python, ruby","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
